fixture cam_step_up
doc docs/adr/0011: landing on higher ground moves the camera up to it at the lerp
room test/camera
spawn 1000 1920
frames 200
input
  # Onto the 160 u ledge, then a double jump onto the 320 u one.
  0..9 R
  10..29 R jump
  30..51 R
  52..70 R jump
  71..75 R
  76..90 R jump
end
expect
  mark first 11..59 event.land=1
  at first y=1760u
  mark second 87..199 event.land=1
  at second y=1600u
end
